			(property "Description" "Digilent Cmod A7-35T Artix-7 module, 48-pin DIP (600 mil). Pin names PIOn/<FPGA ball> per Cmod-A7-Master.xdc. VU: 3.32-5.5V in, or USB 5V out via Schottky when micro-USB attached (do not backfeed). XA0/XA1: 0-3.3V analog, ~3.3k load to GND (2.32k+1k divider) to XADC."
